"Learning these names isn't about memorizing a list for its own sake. It matters because a doctor doesn't just ask \"is this person's qi weak\" — they ask which kind is weak, since a weak defensive qi (frequent colds) calls for a different response than a weak source qi (a lifelong constitutional frailty). The single word \"qi\" from the first lesson of this course was always shorthand for this more specific, four-part system underneath it.": "a7f92e6df671",
